stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Empty
    Empty --> PositiveBalance: deposit(amount)
    PositiveBalance --> PositiveBalance: deposit(amount)
    PositiveBalance --> PositiveBalance: withdraw(valid)
    PositiveBalance --> PositiveBalance: transfer(valid + fee)
    PositiveBalance --> PositiveBalance: invalid operation / no state change
    PositiveBalance --> [*]: close account
